    sighting: 'Calculated using the Umm al-Qura calendar. In Turkey (Diyanet) and other countries a date may differ by one day. A night already begins the evening before, at Maghrib.',
    remind: 'Remind me of holy days', remindSub: 'Kandil nights at 10 am on the day, Eids at 6 pm the evening before',
